      "sentence": "Name blocks; use constraints, peers, and prompts to restart — not shame.",
      "image_brief": "Blocks are part of the path: fragile constructions teach restart.",
      "notes": "- Blocks are normal in creative work.\n- Naming beats hiding.\n- Techniques from earlier units are restart tools.\nSource: course wording.\nAsk: What block name fits your last stall?",
      "claims": [],
