      "heading": "5 · Sustain beyond the workshop",
      "sentence": "Personal development means habits under real briefs — not a one-day energy spike.",
      "image_brief": "Sustain beyond the workshop: habits under real briefs, not one-day highs.",
      "notes": "- Workshop highs fade; portfolios accumulate.\n- Tie practice to course deliverables so it survives the semester.\n- Avoid wellness theatre — stay tied to making and judging.\nSource: course wording (C1 adjacency in professor brief).\nAsk: Which habit from this course will survive after the exam?",
