      "heading": "6 · Autonomy with accountability",
      "sentence": "Own your process inside the brief — without romantic isolation.",
      "image_brief": "Autonomy with accountability: face the brief’s fog without romantic isolation.",
      "notes": "- Autonomy is self-direction within rules, not ignoring the brief.\n- Accountability includes peers, instructors, and future audiences.\n- Declare AI use and cite influences — same as every unit.\nSource: course wording.\nAsk: Where do you need a peer voice this week?",
