      "heading": "Recall check",
      "sentence": "Alone, from memory, 3 minutes. Then compare with a partner.",
      "questions": [
        "Does this unit treat confidence as a mood or as practice?",
        "What two beliefs gate creative action?",
        "What should a success experience teach you?",
        "What is the first move when you hit a block?",
        "What outlasts a workshop high?"
      ],
      "notes": "- Timer: 3 minutes. Students answer alone, from memory; then compare with a partner.\n- Practice only. Nothing is collected or graded.\nAnswers:\n- 1. Practice — from doing creative work (course wording).\n- 2. Can I do this creatively? Should I act creatively here? (centrality / confidence gates).\n- 3. What to repeat, revise, or drop (regulation).\n- 4. Name the block; use constraints, peers, or prompts to restart.\n- 5. Habits under real briefs / portfolio accumulation.\nAsk: Which answer will shape your Lab log today?",
